{
  "title": "Precalculus 2e (OpenStax)",
  "originalText": "This precalculus textmap is intended for college-level Precalculus students and is a comprehensive book that covers more ground than an instructor could likely cover in a typical one- or two-semester course; but instructors should find, almost without fail, that the topics they wish to include in their syllabus are covered in the text.\n\n[Figure: mindtouch.page#thumbnail]\nFront Matter\n\n[Figure: mindtouch.page#thumbnail]\n1: Functions\n\n[Figure: mindtouch.page#thumbnail]\n2: Linear Functions\n\n[Figure: mindtouch.page#thumbnail]\n3: Polynomial and Rational Functions\n\n[Figure: mindtouch.page#thumbnail]\n4: Exponential and Logarithmic Functions\n\n[Figure: mindtouch.page#thumbnail]\n5: Trigonometric Functions\n\n[Figure: mindtouch.page#thumbnail]\n6: Periodic Functions\n\n[Figure: mindtouch.page#thumbnail]\n7: Trigonometric Identities and Equations\n\n[Figure: mindtouch.page#thumbnail]\n8: Further Applications of Trigonometry\n\n[Figure: mindtouch.page#thumbnail]\n9: Systems of Equations and Inequalities\n\n[Figure: mindtouch.page#thumbnail]\n10: Analytic Geometry\n\n[Figure: mindtouch.page#thumbnail]\n11: Sequences, Probability and Counting Theory\n\n[Figure: mindtouch.page#thumbnail]\n12: Introduction to Calculus\n\n[Figure: mindtouch.page#thumbnail]\n13: Appendix\n\n[Figure: mindtouch.page#thumbnail]\nBack Matter\n\nThis page titled Precalculus 2e (OpenStax) was last modified on Sun, 28 May 2023 05:07:27 GMT and is shared under a CC BY  4.0  license and was authored, remixed, and/or curated by OpenStax via source content that was edited to the style and standards of the LibreTexts platform.",
